# Local vitest harness (local only, never deployed).
#
# The suites under /tests exercise the booking engine, the payment path and the
# pack ledger against a real local Postgres, and they are deliberately not part
# of the repo: they need TEST_DATABASE_URL pointed at a throwaway `*_test`
# database and they build their fixtures by deleting rows. The committed checks
# are the `npm run check:*` scripts under scripts/.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash so this only hides the harness at the root — a
# `tests/` folder anywhere else in the tree is still tracked as normal.
/tests/
/vitest.config.mts
